All capsule events during this period feature limited-edition [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] bonus characters - complete your collection and get 'em all!

==Neneko and Gang==
*[[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]]: [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]]'s little sister - now more kawaii!
*[[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]]: Good as a cheap recruit or a source of sweet sweet XP!
*[[Cat Base Mini (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Base Mini]]: A laser-firing decoy to distract enemies from the REAL base!
*[[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]]: The basic cat, reborn shiny and chrome! Takes the hits like a champ and keeps on going!

==Reinforcements==
*[[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]]: An uber-ranged attacker to keep enemies far, far away from the base!
*[[Rich Cat III (Super Rare Cat)|Rich Cat III]]: A penny-pinching scrooge that levels up the [[Worker Cat]] and earns more money on kills!
*[[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]]: A highly intelligent professor that can score XP and prevent enemies from doing any harm!

